	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11537"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=869" title="View the profile of Remedie">Remedie</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 5<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.kompewtaz.com/eq/catav.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=869"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1162.msg11537#msg11537"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1162.msg11537#msg11537">Re: question on trios</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #5 on:</b> October 02, 2004, 12:56:46 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Thanks Sys, I guess I kinda discounted the rogue idea because I&#039;ve seen the rogues on RN with the best of the best equipment and they do great dps but i kinda questioned how it would be for a rogue with only the very minimum of anything or if it&#039;d simply be easier to go with a caster for dps so you had a standard amt of dps from spells (if you know what i mean) but knowing next to nothing about rogues I&#039;m waiting to be corrected there lol<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br />thanks for taking the time to think about it and respond all of you <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
