								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=394"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:tavaran@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1162.msg11823#msg11823"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1162.msg11823#msg11823">Re: question on trios</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #8 on:</b> October 16, 2004, 12:10:15 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Check out Fizwin and his bot Xizzen.&nbsp; Chanter/cleric.&nbsp; The things he does is beyond incredible&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm19.gif" alt="cwm19" border="0" />.&nbsp; When I group with him, its just to tag along and throw a few arrows at whatever mob his pet is killing and to soak up the exp.&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
