							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><span style="color: DarkGreen;">Tavaran Halfelven</span><br /><span style="color: DarkGreen;">66th Ranger of Tunare</span><br />Dendrabates Azureus<br />65th Shaman of Mithaniel Marr<br />Euman D&#039;Argentus<br />65th Cleric of Tunare<br />Skrar Gnomechef<br />63rd Warrior of Rallos Zek<br />Celare D&#039;Argentus<br />62nd Sorceress of Solusek Ro
